{
  "entity": "f_gladiator",
  "source": "data-seed/scripts/f_gladiator.txt",
  "scope": "the whole script, machine-extracted (19 windows)",
  "turns": [
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Do you think he's really dying?",
      "block": 1
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "He's been dying for ten years.",
      "block": 2
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "I think he's really dying this time.",
      "block": 3
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "He has to be bled every night now.",
      "block": 4
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "How do you know that?",
      "block": 5
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "I've been so informed.",
      "block": 6
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "Maybe he just misses us.",
      "block": 7
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Why have we stopped?",
      "block": 8
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p3",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PRAETORIAN GUARD MEMBER",
      "quote": "We're here, sir.",
      "block": 9
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Where is my father?",
      "block": 10
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p4",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "SOLDIER #1",
      "quote": "He's at the front, sir.",
      "block": 11
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Is the battle won?",
      "block": 12
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Take me to my father.",
      "block": 13
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TITUS",
      "quote": "They simply will not surrender.",
      "block": 14
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p6",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "QUINTUS",
      "quote": "Now!",
      "block": 15
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Hold steady... steady...",
      "block": 16
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Steady...",
      "block": 17
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Brothers -- I salute you!  For Rome!",
      "block": 18
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Slave!  Who are you?",
      "block": 19
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "SLAVE!  WHO ARE YOU?",
      "block": 20
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "SLAVE!  WHO ARE YOU?!",
      "block": 21
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Why is he still alive?",
      "block": 22
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I don't know.",
      "block": 23
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Mmm.",
      "block": 24
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I do too.  Simple, elegant...",
      "block": 25
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "What are you going to do?",
      "block": 26
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I'm going to kill him.",
      "block": 27
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Good.",
      "block": 28
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "No?",
      "block": 29
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p8",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "I will fight with you.",
      "block": 30
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p8",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "This isn't your battle.",
      "block": 31
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": null,
      "quote": "Enjoy yourself, Madame...",
      "block": 32
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "Brother, do not be influenced by the\n\t\tmob.  They are a great, faceless\n\t\tbeast --",
      "block": 33
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "They are not \"the mob,\" Lucilla,\n\t\tthey are the people.  They are my\n\t\tchildren and all I want to do is\n\t\tlove them.",
      "block": 34
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": "p2",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Our father loved Maximus... and I\n\t\tlove him still... yet he defies me,\n\t\the tasks me in front of my children.\n\t\tAnd they love him for it.  Just as\n\t\tMarcus loved him for it.  Tell me\n\t\twhy, Lucilla.",
      "block": 35
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "They see themselves in him.  They\n\t\tthrow in their own sad dreams\n\t\talongside his.  They think he fights\n\t\tfor them.",
      "block": 36
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "And what do I do but fight for\n\t\tthem?!  I give them games to please\n\t\tthem.  I strangle dissent to give\n\t\tthem peace.  I empower the\n\t\tPraetorians to give them order.\n\t\tWhat more can I do?!",
      "block": 37
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Say I should fight him, in the\n\t\tarena.  Let my children see who the\n\t\tGods truly favor.",
      "block": 38
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "And what if he should win?",
      "block": 39
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "A God is more powerful than a man...",
      "block": 40
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p2",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCILLA",
      "quote": "Mercy.",
      "block": 41
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "As will I, Commodus.  As will I.",
      "block": 42
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Will you always mistrust me?",
      "block": 43
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Why don't you ask your father that?",
      "block": 44
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "No, Caesar... I will show you.",
      "block": 45
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Where is my sister?",
      "block": 46
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Where is my sister?",
      "block": 47
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p10",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HANDMAIDEN",
      "quote": "She's out, sir...",
      "block": 48
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Where?",
      "block": 49
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p10",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "HANDMAIDEN",
      "quote": "I... don't know, Caesar.",
      "block": 50
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Was it Centurion...?  General...?",
      "block": 51
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PROXIMO",
      "quote": "Captain.",
      "block": 52
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PROXIMO",
      "quote": "How did you know?",
      "block": 53
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "A soldier knows a soldier.",
      "block": 54
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "No --",
      "block": 55
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PROXIMO",
      "quote": "Now I am just an entertainer.",
      "block": 56
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p9",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "You're not coming?",
      "block": 57
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PROXIMO",
      "quote": "They are killing my men!",
      "block": 58
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p9",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PROXIMO",
      "quote": "Gods... they're killing them all.",
      "block": 59
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p11",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "LUCIUS",
      "quote": "What is that fire?",
      "block": 60
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p12",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "PRAETORIAN",
      "quote": "Caesar...",
      "block": 61
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p1",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "COMMODUS",
      "quote": "Oh... that's for my sister.",
      "block": 62
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p5",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "TITUS",
      "quote": "By all the Gods...",
      "block": 63
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p5",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Old friend...",
      "block": 64
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p5",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Where is he?",
      "block": 65
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p6",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "I forgive you.",
      "block": 66
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "For my wife!",
      "block": 67
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "For my son!",
      "block": 68
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "opp",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "For my father!",
      "block": 69
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": "p1",
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "We who are about to die salute you.",
      "block": 70
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p13",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "GRACCHUS",
      "quote": "you.",
      "block": 71
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p13",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "GRACCHUS",
      "quote": "General, the purple is yours if you",
      "block": 72
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p13",
      "to": "p7",
      "stance": "ally",
      "cue": "GRACCHUS",
      "quote": "so desire.  The Senate will support",
      "block": 73
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Rome... you are better than this.",
      "block": 74
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "Look inside yourselves.  I challenge",
      "block": 75
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "you to find your true voice.  Help",
      "block": 76
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "the Senate speak for you.  Make them",
      "block": 77
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "your champion... And dare to think",
      "block": 78
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "what could be.",
      "block": 79
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "I give you back the dream.",
      "block": 80
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "When everything has calmed down,",
      "block": 81
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "lead an orderly withdrawal.  Take",
      "block": 82
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "them home.",
      "block": 83
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "It doesn't look it now... but soon",
      "block": 84
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "we'll have it growing again... Next",
      "block": 85
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "year there will be vines, and then",
      "block": 86
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "there will be grapes... It will be",
      "block": 87
    },
    {
      "speaker": "p7",
      "to": null,
      "stance": "neu",
      "cue": "MAXIMUS",
      "quote": "alive.",
      "block": 88
    }
